  "description": "A beautifully presented, recently renovated 4-bedroom detached cottage situated in the peaceful rural setting of Cloonanass, Kilmurry, approximately 3km from Sixmilebridge village. \n\nSet on a private half-acre site, the property is surrounded by mature grounds and enjoys uninterrupted countryside views, offering a peaceful and private setting while remaining conveniently located for commuting to Shannon, Limerick, Ennis and surrounding employment centres.\n\nThe cottage is fully furnished and offers comfortable accommodation throughout, with a number of practical features including a utility room, garage, outhouse, pantry and generous outdoor space.\n\nProperty Features:\n• 4 bedrooms\n• 2 bathrooms\n• 1 bedroom with ensuite\n• 1 kitchen / living area with a solid fuel stove\n• Fully furnished\n• Recently renovated\n• Spacious utility room\n• Pantry\n• Fully equipped kitchen with all appliances\n• Oil-fired central heating\n• Broadband available\n• Mature grounds and garden\n• Private half-acre site\n• Extensive private parking\n• Uninterrupted countryside views\n• Very quiet and peaceful location\n• BER Rating: D\n• Available immediately\n\nLocation & Commuting:\nThe property offers an excellent combination of peaceful countryside living and accessibility to major employment and transport centres. Sixmilebridge village is approximately 3km away, providing access to local shops, services and amenities.\n\nThe location is convenient for commuters travelling to:\n• Shannon Free Zone\n• Shannon Airport\n• Raheen Business Park\n• University Hospital Limerick\n• Ennis Town\n• Limerick\n• Galway\n\nRental Details:\n• Rent: €1,800 per month\n• Available immediately.\n• No smoking permitted on the premises.\n• References required.\n• ENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY.\n\nViewing strictly by prior appointment.",
